  ("‘she’s a lazy person’. Unos/unas is used in the plural to retain the distinction: son desgraciados" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6939 0.7103 0.7102 0.0165 0.0072 0.2510 0.0475)
  ("‘they’re unhappy’, son unos desgraciados ‘they’re wretches’ (the meaning changes and is quite" 0.0920 0.9081 0.7104 0.7268 0.7267 0.0165 0.0075 0.2582 0.0646)
